# Coding firmware: closed-loop OODA verification & AST/Delta repair (InternalMonologue + ToolchainVerification).
k 2.5
lambda 0.03
hops 8
top always
order witness

role by UPOS
role 1 NOUN ADJ NUM
role 0.75 PROPN
role 0.5 VERB ADV ADP PART
role 0.25 PRON DET CCONJ PUNCT
role 0.15 SCONJ
role 0.10 AUX

for hop
  fan 4096

for search
  fan 512

for pull
  fan 4096
  lexicalization wn-lmf Sense language ili
  up @wn-lmf/Sense
  usages wordnet-cntlist tag_cnt
  rounds 3
  breadth 64
  nearest 256
  walks 64
  walkfan 512
  steps 4
  restart 0.25
  sure 2
  lift 2
  elect grounds continuity agree heads cooccur walks shape confidence shared
  tie first
  seed observation
  ooda 3
  salience 0.15
  multitier on
  combine on
  refuse predicate BNC PENN GF PT NER WSL Target Other Sent Verb Noun Adj Prep Adv UPOS XPOS DEPREL FEATS MISC LEMMA type n f itype "identifier vocabulary" "pronunciation of a form" "variety of language" "other form" identifies "syntactic behaviour"
  lateral hypernym instance_hypernym hyponym instance_hyponym mero_part holo_part mero_member holo_member mero_substance holo_substance derivation pertainym antonym similar also attribute domain_topic has_domain_topic domain_region has_domain_region exemplifies is_exemplified_by "a description of the tag or subtag in the record" other "example usage"
  negate not no never without neither nor
  negate_relation antonym excludes contradicts
  scope_stop . ; : ? ! ,
